Newdevice geom3d
Geom3D
QArrName QuadricArray
CompName Composition

Object PMMAPlate
PMMA Vacuum
6
PlateXm PlateXp PlateZm PlateZp PlateYm PlateYp

; A segunda geometria substitui PMMA por vácuo no interior do furo.
Object ThroughHole
Vacuum PMMA
3
Hole HoleYm HoleYp

Object AluminumFilter
Al Vacuum
6
FilterXm FilterXp FilterZm FilterZp FilterYm FilterYp
End
